{
  "text": "紫微斗數全書",
  "juan": "卷一",
  "section": "星垣問答論_Tianfu",
  "entries": [
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L001",
      "original_quote": "問天府所主若何？",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "星垣問答論",
        "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L001",
        "base_edition_lock": "羅洪先編本"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L002",
      "original_quote": "答曰：天府屬土，南斗主令第一星也。為財帛之主宰，在斗司福權之宿，會吉皆為富貴之基，定作文昌之論。",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "星垣問答論",
        "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L002",
        "base_edition_lock": "羅洪先編本"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L003",
      "original_quote": "希夷先生曰：天府乃南斗延壽解厄之星，又曰司命。上相鎮國之星，在斗司權，在數則職掌財帛、田宅、衣祿之神。",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "星垣問答論",
        "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L003",
        "base_edition_lock": "羅洪先編本"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L004",
      "original_quote": "為帝之佐貳，能制羊陀為從，能化火鈴為福。主人相貌清奇，稟性溫良端雅。",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "星垣問答論",
        "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L004",
        "base_edition_lock": "羅洪先編本"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L005",
      "original_quote": "與昌曲會，必登首選。逢祿存武曲，必有巨萬之富。秘云：天府為祿庫，命逢終是富是也。",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "星垣問答論",
        "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L005",
        "base_edition_lock": "羅洪先編本"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L006",
      "original_quote": "不喜四殺沖破，雖無官貴，亦主財田富足。以田宅財帛為廟樂，以奴僕相貌為陷弱。以兄弟為平常。",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "星垣問答論",
        "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L006",
        "base_edition_lock": "羅洪先編本"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L007",
      "original_quote": "命逢之得相佐，主夫妻子女不缺。若值空亡是為孤立，不可一例而推斷，大抵此星多主吉。",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "星垣問答論",
        "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L007",
        "base_edition_lock": "羅洪先編本"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L008",
      "original_quote": "又曰：此星不論諸宮皆吉，女命得之清正機巧，旺夫益子，雖見沖破，亦以善論，僧道宜之有師號。",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "星垣問答論",
        "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L008",
        "base_edition_lock": "羅洪先編本"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L009",
      "original_quote": "歌曰",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "星垣問答論",
        "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L009",
        "base_edition_lock": "羅洪先編本"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L010",
      "original_quote": "天府為祿庫，入命終是富，萬傾置田庄，家資無論數，女命坐香閨，男人食天祿，",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "星垣問答論",
        "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L010",
        "base_edition_lock": "羅洪先編本"
      }
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L011",
      "original_quote": "此是福吉星，四外無不足。",
      "tag": [],
      "tag_reason": "",
      "_source": {
        "text": "紫微斗數全書",
        "juan": "卷一",
        "section": "星垣問答論",
        "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_WendaTianfu_L011",
        "base_edition_lock": "羅洪先編本"
      }
    }
  ],
  "_extraction_status": "星垣問答論-Tianfu星部分完成"
}